{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  product-media-gallery — estilos da página de produto
  ============================================================

  O QUE FAZ:
  Todo o CSS da página de produto (sections/main-product.liquid):

  DESKTOP (> 1000px)
  - Grid de 2 colunas dentro da margem padrão (.page-width/--gutter).
  - Galeria: cada mídia tem a altura útil da tela
    (100svh − header − 2 × margem) e a largura toda da coluna,
    com object-fit: cover. Mídias empilhadas, uma "tela" por foto.
  - Informações: position: sticky + min-height de uma tela, com o
    conteúdo centralizado na vertical. Enquanto as fotos rolam, as
    informações ficam paradas ao lado.

  CELULAR (≤ 1000px)
  - Galeria vira carrossel horizontal (scroll-snap) de ponta a ponta
    da tela (sangra a margem), com pontinhos indicadores.
  - Informações logo abaixo, fluxo normal.

  COMO USAR:
  {% render 'product-media-gallery', section_id: section.id %}
  (só CSS — não gera HTML)
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  .section-main-product .product {
    --altura-util: calc(100svh - var(--header-altura, 72px) - var(--gutter) * 2);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 88px);
    padding-top: var(--gutter);
    padding-bottom: var(--espaco-secao);
  }

  /* ---------- Galeria ---------- */
  .product__media-wrapper { position: relative; min-width: 0; }
  .product__media-list { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .product__media-item {
    position: relative;
    height: var(--altura-util);
    min-height: 420px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--media-radius);
    background-color: var(--color-background-contrast);
  }
  .product__media-item img,
  .product__media-item video,
  .product__media-item iframe,
  .product__media-item model-viewer {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .product__media-item .placeholder-svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 20%, transparent); }
  .product__media-item.is-destaque { animation: pdp-destaque 650ms var(--ease-out); }
  .product__pontos { display: none; }

  /* ---------- Informações (100vh, fixas ao lado da galeria) ---------- */
  .product__info {
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--header-altura, 72px) + var(--gutter));
    min-height: var(--altura-util);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .product__info-conteudo { width: 100%; max-width: 480px; }

  .product__vendor { font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.6; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .product__title { font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.2vw, 2.9rem); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .product__ficha { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.9375rem; opacity: 0.65; }
  .product__price { margin: 22px 0 28px; }
  .product__unit-price,
  .product__tax { font-size: 0.8125rem; opacity: 0.65; margin-top: 6px; }
  .product__tax a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; }

  .price { display: flex; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 12px; font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .price__compare { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.5; }
  .price__sale { color: var(--color-text); }
  .price__badge {
    align-self: center;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #fff;
    background-color: var(--color-sale);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  /* ---------- Opções (variantes) ---------- */
  .product__variants { display: grid; gap: 22px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .product__option { border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0; min-width: 0; }
  .product__option-name { display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .product__option-valor { margin-left: 6px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: none; font-size: 0.9375rem; opacity: 0.7; }
  .product__option-valores { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }

  .product__swatch {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 48px;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0 18px;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color var(--dur-fast) ease, background-color var(--dur-fast) ease, color var(--dur-fast) ease;
  }
  .product__swatch:hover { border-color: var(--color-text); }
  .product__swatch.is-selected { color: var(--color-background); background: var(--color-text); border-color: var(--color-text); }
  .product__swatch.is-unavailable { opacity: 0.4; text-decoration: line-through; }
  .product__swatch:focus-within { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 2px; }

  /* Bolinhas de cor (Metal/Cor): círculo com anel quando selecionado */
  .product__swatch--cor { min-width: 0; width: 44px; height: 44px; padding: 0; border-color: transparent; }
  .product__swatch--cor.is-selected { background: transparent; border-color: var(--color-text); }
  .product__swatch-color,
  .product__swatch-media {
    display: block;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.12);
    transition: transform var(--dur-base) var(--ease-spring);
  }
  .product__swatch--cor:hover .product__swatch-color { transform: scale(1.08); }

  /* ---------- Quantidade ---------- */
  .product__quantity { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .quantity-selector {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 48px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--buttons-radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .quantity__button {
    width: 46px;
    height: 100%;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: inherit;
    background: none;
    transition: background-color var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .quantity__button:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 7%, transparent); }
  .quantity__input {
    width: 44px;
    height: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: inherit;
    background: transparent;
    -moz-appearance: textfield;
  }
  .quantity__input::-webkit-outer-spin-button,
  .quantity__input::-webkit-inner-spin-button { -webkit-appearance: none; margin: 0; }

  /* ---------- Comprar ---------- */
  .product__buy-buttons { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .product__buy-buttons .shopify-payment-button { margin-top: 10px; }

  /* ---------- Descrição em acordeão ---------- */
  .product__acordeao { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); margin-top: 20px; }
  .product__acordeao-titulo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    min-height: 56px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    list-style: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .product__acordeao-titulo::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .product__acordeao-icone { position: relative; width: 12px; height: 12px; }
  .product__acordeao-icone::before,
  .product__acordeao-icone::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 0; width: 12px; height: 1px; background: currentColor; transition: transform var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out); }
  .product__acordeao-icone::after { transform: rotate(90deg); }
  .product__acordeao[open] .product__acordeao-icone::after { transform: rotate(0deg); }
  .product__description { padding-bottom: 20px; font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.7; opacity: 0.85; }
  .product__acordeao[open] .product__description { animation: pdp-abre 450ms var(--ease-out); }

  .product__share { margin-top: 12px; }

  @keyframes pdp-destaque { from { opacity: 0.2; transform: scale(0.985); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
  @keyframes pdp-abre { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-6px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }

  /* ---------- Celular: carrossel de ponta a ponta ---------- */
  @media screen and (max-width: 1000px) {
    .section-main-product .product { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; padding-top: 0; }
    .product__media-wrapper { margin: 0 calc(var(--gutter) * -1); }  /* sangra a margem: foto de ponta a ponta */
    .product__media-list {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }
    .product__media-list::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .product__media-item { flex: 0 0 100%; height: auto; min-height: 0; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; border-radius: 0; scroll-snap-align: start; scroll-snap-stop: always; }
    .product__pontos { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 14px; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; pointer-events: none; }
    .product__ponto { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-text); opacity: 0.25; transition: opacity var(--dur-fast), transform var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out); }
    .product__ponto.is-ativo { opacity: 0.85; transform: scale(1.2); }
    .product__info { position: static; min-height: 0; display: block; }
    .product__info-conteudo { max-width: none; }
  }
</style>
